  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1002:b001:l020": "Twelve khans and ten divisions retained as printed; no reconciliation with other enumerations.",
    "manas-2010:p1003:b001:l032": "Twenty nights here and twenty days in the following line retained; not harmonized with forty days at1004:l019.",
    "manas-2010:p1004:b001:l019": "Forty days as printed despite preceding twenty-day formulation.",
    "manas-2010:p1005:b001:l008": "Чекири жок кой көз: sheep-like eyes without pale irises; conventional approving portrait, not an invented eye disorder.",
    "manas-2010:p1005:b001:l018": "Күл азык concentrated dry travel provisions; no particular modern recipe supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1006:b001:l001": "Forty foot-lengths retained as a bodily measure; no exact metric conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p1006:b001:l003": "Томпой shooting pieces in the ordo knucklebone game; the source explicitly says they are made from stone here.",
    "manas-2010:p1006:b001:l004": "Game action interpreted as selecting players capable of breaking the cluster; exact historical playing rule remains provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p1006:b001:l008": "Ordo close-range flicking action rendered contextually; not asserted to match modern competition rules.",
    "manas-2010:p1006:b001:l023": "Буурул түндүн Тешик-Таш retained as gray-night Teshik-Tash; compressed geographical epithet uncertain, no silent replacement with north.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l008": "Fire protection is the speaker’s epic claim for clothing; no factual technical property of silk asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l009": "Кадек Chinese silk fabric, Yudakhin and2015 dictionary https://el-sozduk.kg/кадек/; silk coat in this clothing context, not unverified armor material.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l013": "Offering the speaker’s own blood in a flask retained literally as epic speech.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l022": "Кадек silk fabric, same positive dictionary identification as:l009.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l025": "Тинте saber/dagger positively glossed in this PDF1842:b001:l039. Кийип literally wearing is retained as wearing a weapon, though clothing parallel makes the phrase unusual. No silk-fabric meaning invented; raw Ак тинтем unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p1008:b001:l037": "Тулпар noble/exceptional steed; no physical wings added where this verse does not mention them.",
    "manas-2010:p1009:b001:l041": "Чайдоос kettle for boiling tea, Yudakhin and1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/чайдоос/. Abrupt Samarkand comparison retained in its original position.",
    "manas-2010:p1010:b001:l016": "Kökchebichin named as printed amid the journey; not silently harmonized to Sarala despite possible mount/subject inconsistency.",
    "manas-2010:p1010:b001:l042": "Азиретаалы Holy Ali; Duldul in the next page is Ali’s legendary mount. Other bare Азирет epithets not automatically assigned to a particular prophet.",
    "manas-2010:p1011:b001:l006": "Арбагың угуп колдосун compressed syntax, following the populous Chinese people. Provisionally they hear your spirit and support; omitted case/subject could instead yield a petition to ancestral spirits. Raw unaltered.",
    "manas-2010:p1012:b001:l026": "Жылгынды treated as place name Zhylgyndy; not silently assimilated to the later adjectival Жылгындуу valley.",
    "manas-2010:p1013:b001:l035": "Putting grass on the tracks is retained as the printed pursuit image; intensive following is the contextual force, not a claim of gardening.",
    "manas-2010:p1014:b001:l026": "Сел literally flood retained. Possible defective text or metaphor for following support; no silent substitution of эл people.",
    "manas-2010:p1014:b001:l028": "Making a gray one from white horses retained literally in the oath context. Selection or ritual action unclear; no unmentioned sacrifice supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1014:b001:l035": "Printed Мунас provisionally read as Manas from immediate narrative identity; raw spelling retained in extraction.",
    "manas-2010:p1015:b001:l029": "Тутам handspan retained in compressed duration comparison; no conversion to a measured time.",
    "manas-2010:p1015:b001:l032": "The gray one struck by God retained as printed. Following sleet/cloud imagery may refer to the sky, but a particular horse or weather event is not securely identifiable.",
    "manas-2010:p1015:b001:l040": "Кара баскан hostile affliction/evil-spirit curse in quoted speech, not an independent judgment about the wife.",
    "manas-2010:p1016:b001:l011": "Quoted insult spans:l011–012; scouting clause and Chinese epithet remain on their respective source lines.",
    "manas-2010:p1016:b001:l019": "Ал келбесе it/he does not come provisionally refers to the death-hour in:l018; source pronoun remains ambiguous.",
    "manas-2010:p1016:b001:l042": "Saddling the horse retained despite earlier instruction to slaughter Sarala at:l039; no alternate horse invented to repair the contradiction.",
    "manas-2010:p1017:b001:l018": "Мээси жок literally brainless retained; possible ээси owner defect would parallel the next line, but is not silently adopted.",
    "manas-2010:p1017:b001:l022": "Бил elephant in the comparison, not the ordinary verb know.",
    "manas-2010:p1017:b001:l028": "Heels not bleeding is the attested childlessness idiom: Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/согончок/. Literal bodily image retained, meaning she has borne no child.",
    "manas-2010:p1017:b001:l034": "Mazhik treated as named addressee within the instructions concerning Aruuke; death-will speech is reproduced without modern marital assumptions.",
    "manas-2010:p1018:b001:l006": "Улама learned transmitters/received tradition; the following claims are explicitly hearsay, not independently verified biography.",
    "manas-2010:p1018:b001:l016": "Ике contextually read as нике marriage with missing initial н; raw preserved. Forty wives and eighty years both retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1018:b001:l020": "Ат кара тил болгондо positively defined as early summer when horses feed fully on green grass and their tongues darken from its sap:2015 explanatory/phraseological dictionaries https://el-sozduk.kg/АТ%20КАРА%20ТИЛ%20БОЛГОНДО/. Not a season of famine.",
    "manas-2010:p1018:b001:l022": "Курумшу ragged old felt, Yudakhin and2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/курумшу/; not generic woven cloth.",
    "manas-2010:p1018:b001:l036": "Explicit uncertainty whether Chubak’s origin story is true retained; mutually differing reported genealogies not reconciled.",
    "manas-2010:p1019:b001:l005": "Insult concerning birth to an unmarried girl retained as reported speech; not asserted narrator fact.",
    "manas-2010:p1019:b001:l008": "Кызыталак curse retained as damned; literal daughter-divorce etymology does not specify an actual marital event.",
    "manas-2010:p1019:b001:l038": "Дاڭкан/даңкан hoof-thrown clods, as established in earlier lexical work; cauldron size retained as epic hyperbole.",
    "manas-2010:p1020:b001:l003": "Мада plunge/thrust firmly, primary Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/мада/. Мылгытып expressive plunging action remains contextually qualified; no specific gait invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1020:b001:l015": "Күн rendered sky/weather in the thunder comparison rather than an unsupported physical claim that the sun thunders.",
    "manas-2010:p1020:b001:l031": "Жол road retained despite possible жоо enemy defect in the rhetorical parallel; raw not silently corrected.",
