    "manas-2010:p1021:b001:l032": "Жылгындуу rendered tamarisk-bearing descriptively; may also function as a place name.",
    "manas-2010:p1021:b001:l033": "Огой provisionally Nogoy with lost initial н, matching repeated Argyn–Nogoy formula. Raw remains огой.",
